sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant Parent as Parent / Settings Screen
    participant GSOL as GeneralSettingsOverviewLayout
    participant History as HistoryContainer

    Parent->>GSOL: props (onPressUserSettings, onPressChannelSettings, onPressPricings, showHistory)

    GSOL->>GSOL: render Recent section (optional)
    GSOL->>History: render HistoryContainer (timeAgo, titleText, etc.)

    GSOL->>GSOL: render General > Account card (Likes, Dislikes, User Settings, Channel Settings, Pricings)

    User->>GSOL: tap "User Settings"
    GSOL->>Parent: onPressUserSettings()

    User->>GSOL: tap "Channel Settings"
    GSOL->>Parent: onPressChannelSettings()

    User->>GSOL: tap "Pricings"
    GSOL->>Parent: onPressPricings()